WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
If you want to see them on the system,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
just connect the system to the camera.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
So, you are using a router and also the Raspberry Pi.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
So, it connects all your devices.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
There is your router, the Raspberry Pi,
a camera, and a switch.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
So, it connects multiple cameras to the switch.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Once it gets to the switch, it is pushed to the back end,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
and the organization can manage
the different cameras on the front end.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
So, this is the camera.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.900
And this is the front end.
